<title>UK: Cookson down as Hoare Govett downgrades.</title>
<headline>Cookson down as Hoare Govett downgrades.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Cookson Plc dropped on Wednesday as analysts at ABN AMRO Hoare Govett lowered their rating on the stock, traders said.</p>
<p>Cookson shares were down 11p at 237 by 0953 GMT.</p>
</text>
